      "formula_id": "math:trace-bounded-right-inverse-full-fourier-proof:011",
      "source_latex": "\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:trace-right-inverse-weighted-norm-bound}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\|u\\|_{s,2}^2&\\leq C_1\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^m}|\\hat u(\\bm{\\xi})|^2(1+|\\bm{\\xi}|^2)^s\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{\\xi}\\\\\n&=C_2\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^{m-1}}(1+|\\bm{\\xi}^{\\prime}|^2)^{2s-1}|\\hat\\phi(\\bm{\\xi}^{\\prime})|^2\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}(1+|\\bm{\\xi}|^2)^{-s}\\,\\mathrm{d}\\xi_m\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{\\xi}^{\\prime}\\\\\n&\\leq C_3\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^{m-1}}(1+|\\bm{\\xi}^{\\prime}|^2)^{s-1/2}|\\hat\\phi(\\bm{\\xi}^{\\prime})|^2\\,\\mathrm{d}\\bm{\\xi}^{\\prime}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\end{equation}",
